Third-party provenance for the checked-in Basalt oracle and fixture sources
==========================================================================

The benchmark directory is classified as newly written C++ diagnostic programs
and Python/PowerShell/shell harnesses.  The audit found no copied upstream
source subtree; these files call the pinned upstream Basalt, OpenGV, Sophus,
Eigen, and OpenCV packages.  Keep
this notice with any source or binary redistribution of these diagnostics.

